Package: kubuntu-installer-prompt
Architecture: any
Depends: calamares-settings-kubuntu, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Pre-Depends: ${misc:Pre-Depends}
Description: Live ISO prompt for trying or installing Kubuntu
 This application displays a screen allowing the user to either try or
 install Kubuntu after booting the Kubuntu ISO file. It auto-launches
 when the ISO is first booted, and will either launch Calamares or Plasma,
 depending on the user's choice.
